</div></div><figcaption>One path, edge to answer &mdash; ingest, correlate, then render for the role that asked.</figcaption></figure><div class="chips stg"><div class="chip rv"><span class="ic"><svg class="i"><use href="#p-clock"/></svg></span><span><b>Weeks, not quarters</b><span>Measurable success in a matter of weeks</span></span></div><div class="chip rv"><span class="ic"><svg class="i"><use href="#p-flow"/></svg></span><span><b>Production | service | supply chain</b><span>One experience across all three</span></span></div><div class="chip rv"><span class="ic"><svg class="i"><use href="#p-users"/></svg></span><span><b>Role-specific outcomes</b><span>Built for the persona, not the dashboard</span></span></div></div></div></section><section class="ph-sec ph-layers jwrap" id="layers"><div class="jhead rv"><p class="kicker">The platform</p><h2>Four layers. Data rises, outcomes land.</h2><p>Every signal starts at the edge and climbs. Scroll to follow one up through the stack, or jump straight to a layer.</p></div><div class="jpin" data-beat="0"><span class="jprog" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="jstage"><div class="jplate"><svg class="lfig on" viewBox="0 0 1376 768" role="img" aria-labelledby="lgT1 lgD1"><title id="lgT1">Edge and universe connectivity</title><desc id="lgD1">Machines, sensors, cameras, IoT devices and other devices feed a data pipeline into cloud and on-premises infrastructure.</desc><g class="gnd"><path d="M110 650H1266"/><path d="M190 700H1186"/><path d="M330 650l-46 50M620 650l-30 50M900 650l30 50M1150 650l46 50"/></g><path class="spine" d="M404 420H972"/><path class="flow" pathLength="100" d="M404 420H972"/><text class="cap" x="74" y="80">DEVICE SOURCES</text><text class="cap" x="544" y="80">DATA PIPELINE</text><text class="cap" x="972" y="80">INFRASTRUCTURE</text><path class="wire" d="M404 268.0C474.0 268.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 344.0C474.0 344.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 420.0C474.0 420.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 496.0C474.0 496.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 572.0C474.0 572.0 474.0 420.0 544 420"/><path class="wire" d="M972 382.0C902.0 382.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 458.0C902.0 458.0 902.0 420.0 832 420"/><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="239.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="268.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="276.0">Machines</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="315.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="344.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="352.0">Sensors</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="391.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="420.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="428.0">Cameras</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="467.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="496.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="504.0">IoT devices</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="543.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="572.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="580.0">Other devices</text></g><g class="core"><rect x="544" y="330" width="288" height="180" rx="16"/><path class="hair" d="M600 380h176M600 420h176M600 460h176"/><circle class="hot" cx="688" cy="420" r="10"/><text class="fn" x="688" y="556">CONNECTORS &#38; DRIVERS</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="353.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="382.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="390.0">Cloud</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="429.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="458.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="466.0">On-premises</text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(400,118)"><rect width="310" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd ok" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Connectors <tspan class="v">Pre-built</tspan></text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(940,600)"><rect width="321" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Assets <tspan class="v">Out-of-the-box</tspan></text></g></svg><svg class="lfig" viewBox="0 0 1376 768" role="img" aria-labelledby="lgT2 lgD2"><title id="lgT2">Data ingestion layer</title><desc id="lgD2">IoT data, systems of record and big data pass through connectors into a data source block handling load configuration, scheduling, ETL, chunking and AI/ML modelling.</desc><g class="gnd"><path d="M110 650H1266"/><path d="M190 700H1186"/><path d="M330 650l-46 50M620 650l-30 50M900 650l30 50M1150 650l46 50"/></g><path class="spine" d="M404 420H972"/><path class="flow" pathLength="100" d="M404 420H972"/><text class="cap" x="74" y="80">SOURCES</text><text class="cap" x="544" y="80">CONNECTORS</text><text class="cap" x="972" y="80">READY TO USE</text><path class="wire" d="M404 344.0C474.0 344.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 420.0C474.0 420.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 496.0C474.0 496.0 474.0 420.0 544 420"/><path class="wire" d="M972 344.0C902.0 344.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 420.0C902.0 420.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 496.0C902.0 496.0 902.0 420.0 832 420"/><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="315.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="344.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="352.0">Complex event streams</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="391.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="420.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="428.0">Systems of record</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="467.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="496.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="504.0">Big data</text></g><g class="core"><rect x="544" y="300" width="288" height="240" rx="16"/><path d="M544 356h288"/><text class="fn" x="688" y="332">DATA SOURCE BLOCK</text><text class="fn dim" x="688" y="400">Load config</text><text class="fn dim" x="688" y="440">ETL &#183; Chunking</text><text class="fn dim" x="688" y="480">AI / ML modelling</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="315.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="344.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="352.0">Modelled</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="391.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="420.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="428.0">Scheduled</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="467.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="496.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="504.0">Classified</text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(400,118)"><rect width="476" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Ingest <tspan class="v">Volume &#183; Velocity &#183; Variety</tspan></text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(940,600)"><rect width="345" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd ok" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Sanctity <tspan class="v">Across sources</tspan></text></g></svg><svg class="lfig" viewBox="0 0 1376 768" role="img" aria-labelledby="lgT3 lgD3"><title id="lgT3">Intelligent processing layer</title><desc id="lgD3">A data source block and scripting, data-science and backend runtimes feed a Non-Obvious Relationship Attributes engine, which renders charts for the user experience.</desc><g class="gnd"><path d="M110 650H1266"/><path d="M190 700H1186"/><path d="M330 650l-46 50M620 650l-30 50M900 650l30 50M1150 650l46 50"/></g><path class="spine" d="M404 420H972"/><path class="flow" pathLength="100" d="M404 420H972"/><text class="cap" x="74" y="80">RUNTIMES</text><text class="cap" x="544" y="80">CORRELATION</text><text class="cap" x="972" y="80">WHAT COMES OUT</text><path class="wire" d="M404 344.0C474.0 344.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 420.0C474.0 420.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 496.0C474.0 496.0 474.0 420.0 544 420"/><path class="wire" d="M972 344.0C902.0 344.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 420.0C902.0 420.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 496.0C902.0 496.0 902.0 420.0 832 420"/><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="315.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="344.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="352.0">Scripting runtime</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="391.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="420.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="428.0">Data-science runtime</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="467.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="496.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="504.0">Backend runtime</text></g><g class="core"><circle cx="688" cy="420" r="96"/><circle class="ring" cx="688" cy="420" r="116"/><path class="hair" d="M652 386l36 34 38-38M652 386l-6 50 42-16M726 382l24 44-62 10"/><circle cx="652" cy="386" r="8"/><circle cx="726" cy="382" r="8"/><circle cx="646" cy="436" r="8"/><circle cx="750" cy="426" r="8"/><circle class="hot" cx="688" cy="420" r="13"/><text class="fn" x="688" y="572">NORA ENGINE</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="315.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="344.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="352.0">Correlated attributes</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="391.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="420.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="428.0">Derived measures</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="467.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="496.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="504.0">Persona outcomes</text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(400,118)"><rect width="369" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Relationships <tspan class="v">Non-obvious</tspan></text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(940,600)"><rect width="310" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd ok" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Driven by <tspan class="v">Human + AI</tspan></text></g></svg><svg class="lfig" viewBox="0 0 1376 768" role="img" aria-labelledby="lgT4 lgD4"><title id="lgT4">Experience layer</title><desc id="lgD4">Insights, recommendations and trends are rendered for the role that asked, as structured visualisation, contextual drilldown, ad-hoc analysis and API-driven access.</desc><g class="gnd"><path d="M110 650H1266"/><path d="M190 700H1186"/><path d="M330 650l-46 50M620 650l-30 50M900 650l30 50M1150 650l46 50"/></g><path class="spine" d="M404 420H972"/><path class="flow" pathLength="100" d="M404 420H972"/><text class="cap" x="74" y="80">WHAT ARRIVES</text><text class="cap" x="544" y="80">RENDERED FOR THE ROLE</text><text class="cap" x="972" y="80">HOW IT IS USED</text><path class="wire" d="M404 344.0C474.0 344.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 420.0C474.0 420.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 496.0C474.0 496.0 474.0 420.0 544 420"/><path class="wire" d="M972 306.0C902.0 306.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 382.0C902.0 382.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 458.0C902.0 458.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 534.0C902.0 534.0 902.0 420.0 832 420"/><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="315.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="344.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="352.0">Insights</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="391.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="420.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="428.0">Recommendations</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="467.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="496.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="504.0">Trends</text></g><g class="core"><rect x="544" y="316" width="288" height="176" rx="16"/><path d="M544 358h288"/><circle class="hair" cx="586" cy="337" r="5"/><circle class="hair" cx="602" cy="337" r="5"/><g class="bar"><rect x="588" y="424" width="26" height="46" rx="5"/><rect x="624" y="404" width="26" height="66" rx="5"/><rect x="660" y="440" width="26" height="30" rx="5"/></g><path class="trend" d="M706 452l24-30 22 16 26-46"/><text class="fn" x="688" y="554">ROLE-CENTRIC RENDER</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="277.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="306.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="314.0">Structured visuals</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="353.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="382.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="390.0">Contextual drilldown</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="429.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="458.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="466.0">Ad-hoc analysis</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="505.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="534.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="542.0">API access</text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(400,118)"><rect width="345" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd ok" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Rendering <tspan class="v">Persona-first</tspan></text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(940,600)"><rect width="274" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Access <tspan class="v">App or API</tspan></text></g></svg></div><div class="jside"><div class="jcopy"><div class="on"><div class="jstep"><b>01</b> / 04<span>Edge &amp; Universe Connectivity</span></div><h3>The perceptron layer</h3><p class="jl">Connect | Collect | Visualize: it starts here. With pre-built connectors and drivers, the platform connects to most enterprise, cloud, industrial assets, sensors, and devices: out-of-the-box.</p><p class="jd">ITHENA&rsquo;s Smart Insights platform empowers users to delve deep into understanding their workforce, processes, and content, thereby facilitating business transformation. Through this platform, you obtain a real-time glimpse into your process performance and the content that propels them. Consequently, this equips you to enhance customer experiences, fortify competitive standing, amplify visibility, and ensure compliance.</p></div><div><div class="jstep"><b>02</b> / 04<span>Data Ingestion Layer</span></div><h3>Velocity | Volume | Variety of data in one place</h3><p class="jl">Housing relevant information by Volume | Velocity | Variety: our integrated data layer ensures the sanctity across sources &amp; destinations.</p><p class="jd">Bringing in data across multiple domains including Complex Event Streams | Telemetry Data | Enterprise Systems of Records | Big Data, our applications bring the best user experience for THAT role.</p></div><div><div class="jstep"><b>03</b> / 04<span>Intelligent Processing Layer</span></div><h3>Driven by Human &amp; Artificial Intelligence</h3><p class="jl">The aggregation | integration | modeling | derivation of all aspects of what users should experience is built in this IPL to enable visual outcomes by personas.</p><p class="jd">The Intelligent Processing Layer serves as the conduit between the varied data sources housed in the Data Layer. This layer enhances the value of data that is brought in through connected machines, TAGs, people and other sub-systems, for eventually providing to the Experience Layer for intelligent industrial outcomes. Behind the scenes, the IPL achieves this ease by modeling, aggregating, deriving, and correlating numerous factors of disparate data.</p></div><div><div class="jstep"><b>04</b> / 04<span>Experience Layer</span></div><h3>Role-centric application workflow</h3><p class="jl">Where users engage, interact and are driven by generative AI based rendering of structured, ad-hoc analysis using computer and natural language processing for their roles.</p><p class="jd">One of the distinguishing features of the ITHENA platform is the persona or role-centricity. Driven by a combination of human and artificial intelligence, we provide analytical outcomes to the relevant persona, and not just the art-of-the-possible scenarios! Our applications bring the best user experience for THAT role, driven by actionable workflows and machine-learned intelligence.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="jrail"><ol aria-label="Platform layers"><li class="on" data-beat="0" role="button" tabindex="0"><i></i>Edge</li><li data-beat="1" role="button" tabindex="0"><i></i>Ingest</li><li data-beat="2" role="button" tabindex="0"><i></i>Process</li><li data-beat="3" role="button" tabindex="0"><i></i>Experience</li></ol></div></div><span class="jtravel" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="jstack"><div class="js rv"><div class="jsfig"><svg class="lfig" viewBox="0 0 1376 768" role="img" aria-labelledby="lgT1 lgD1"><title id="lgT1">Edge and universe connectivity</title><desc id="lgD1">Machines, sensors, cameras, IoT devices and other devices feed a data pipeline into cloud and on-premises infrastructure.</desc><g class="gnd"><path d="M110 650H1266"/><path d="M190 700H1186"/><path d="M330 650l-46 50M620 650l-30 50M900 650l30 50M1150 650l46 50"/></g><path class="spine" d="M404 420H972"/><path class="flow" pathLength="100" d="M404 420H972"/><text class="cap" x="74" y="80">DEVICE SOURCES</text><text class="cap" x="544" y="80">DATA PIPELINE</text><text class="cap" x="972" y="80">INFRASTRUCTURE</text><path class="wire" d="M404 268.0C474.0 268.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 344.0C474.0 344.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 420.0C474.0 420.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 496.0C474.0 496.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 572.0C474.0 572.0 474.0 420.0 544 420"/><path class="wire" d="M972 382.0C902.0 382.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 458.0C902.0 458.0 902.0 420.0 832 420"/><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="239.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="268.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="276.0">Machines</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="315.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="344.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="352.0">Sensors</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="391.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="420.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="428.0">Cameras</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="467.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="496.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="504.0">IoT devices</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="543.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="572.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="580.0">Other devices</text></g><g class="core"><rect x="544" y="330" width="288" height="180" rx="16"/><path class="hair" d="M600 380h176M600 420h176M600 460h176"/><circle class="hot" cx="688" cy="420" r="10"/><text class="fn" x="688" y="556">CONNECTORS &#38; DRIVERS</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="353.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="382.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="390.0">Cloud</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="429.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="458.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="466.0">On-premises</text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(400,118)"><rect width="310" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd ok" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Connectors <tspan class="v">Pre-built</tspan></text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(940,600)"><rect width="321" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Assets <tspan class="v">Out-of-the-box</tspan></text></g></svg></div><div class="t"><span>01 / 04 &middot; Edge &amp; Universe Connectivity</span><h3>The perceptron layer</h3><p>Connect | Collect | Visualize: it starts here. With pre-built connectors and drivers, the platform connects to most enterprise, cloud, industrial assets, sensors, and devices: out-of-the-box.</p><p class="jd">ITHENA&rsquo;s Smart Insights platform empowers users to delve deep into understanding their workforce, processes, and content, thereby facilitating business transformation. Through this platform, you obtain a real-time glimpse into your process performance and the content that propels them. Consequently, this equips you to enhance customer experiences, fortify competitive standing, amplify visibility, and ensure compliance.</p></div></div><div class="js rv"><div class="jsfig"><svg class="lfig" viewBox="0 0 1376 768" role="img" aria-labelledby="lgT2 lgD2"><title id="lgT2">Data ingestion layer</title><desc id="lgD2">IoT data, systems of record and big data pass through connectors into a data source block handling load configuration, scheduling, ETL, chunking and AI/ML modelling.</desc><g class="gnd"><path d="M110 650H1266"/><path d="M190 700H1186"/><path d="M330 650l-46 50M620 650l-30 50M900 650l30 50M1150 650l46 50"/></g><path class="spine" d="M404 420H972"/><path class="flow" pathLength="100" d="M404 420H972"/><text class="cap" x="74" y="80">SOURCES</text><text class="cap" x="544" y="80">CONNECTORS</text><text class="cap" x