an class="v">Across sources</tspan></text></g></svg></div><div class="t"><span>02 / 04 &middot; Data Ingestion Layer</span><h3>Velocity | Volume | Variety of data in one place</h3><p>Housing relevant information by Volume | Velocity | Variety: our integrated data layer ensures the sanctity across sources &amp; destinations.</p><p class="jd">Bringing in data across multiple domains including Complex Event Streams | Telemetry Data | Enterprise Systems of Records | Big Data, our applications bring the best user experience for THAT role.</p></div></div><div class="js rv"><div class="jsfig"><svg class="lfig" viewBox="0 0 1376 768" role="img" aria-labelledby="lgT3 lgD3"><title id="lgT3">Intelligent processing layer</title><desc id="lgD3">A data source block and scripting, data-science and backend runtimes feed a Non-Obvious Relationship Attributes engine, which renders charts for the user experience.</desc><g class="gnd"><path d="M110 650H1266"/><path d="M190 700H1186"/><path d="M330 650l-46 50M620 650l-30 50M900 650l30 50M1150 650l46 50"/></g><path class="spine" d="M404 420H972"/><path class="flow" pathLength="100" d="M404 420H972"/><text class="cap" x="74" y="80">RUNTIMES</text><text class="cap" x="544" y="80">CORRELATION</text><text class="cap" x="972" y="80">WHAT COMES OUT</text><path class="wire" d="M404 344.0C474.0 344.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 420.0C474.0 420.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 496.0C474.0 496.0 474.0 420.0 544 420"/><path class="wire" d="M972 344.0C902.0 344.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 420.0C902.0 420.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 496.0C902.0 496.0 902.0 420.0 832 420"/><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="315.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="344.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="352.0">Scripting runtime</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="391.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="420.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="428.0">Data-science runtime</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="467.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="496.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="504.0">Backend runtime</text></g><g class="core"><circle cx="688" cy="420" r="96"/><circle class="ring" cx="688" cy="420" r="116"/><path class="hair" d="M652 386l36 34 38-38M652 386l-6 50 42-16M726 382l24 44-62 10"/><circle cx="652" cy="386" r="8"/><circle cx="726" cy="382" r="8"/><circle cx="646" cy="436" r="8"/><circle cx="750" cy="426" r="8"/><circle class="hot" cx="688" cy="420" r="13"/><text class="fn" x="688" y="572">NORA ENGINE</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="315.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="344.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="352.0">Correlated attributes</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="391.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="420.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="428.0">Derived measures</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="467.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="496.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="504.0">Persona outcomes</text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(400,118)"><rect width="369" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Relationships <tspan class="v">Non-obvious</tspan></text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(940,600)"><rect width="310" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd ok" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Driven by <tspan class="v">Human + AI</tspan></text></g></svg></div><div class="t"><span>03 / 04 &middot; Intelligent Processing Layer</span><h3>Driven by Human &amp; Artificial Intelligence</h3><p>The aggregation | integration | modeling | derivation of all aspects of what users should experience is built in this IPL to enable visual outcomes by personas.</p><p class="jd">The Intelligent Processing Layer serves as the conduit between the varied data sources housed in the Data Layer. This layer enhances the value of data that is brought in through connected machines, TAGs, people and other sub-systems, for eventually providing to the Experience Layer for intelligent industrial outcomes. Behind the scenes, the IPL achieves this ease by modeling, aggregating, deriving, and correlating numerous factors of disparate data.</p></div></div><div class="js rv"><div class="jsfig"><svg class="lfig" viewBox="0 0 1376 768" role="img" aria-labelledby="lgT4 lgD4"><title id="lgT4">Experience layer</title><desc id="lgD4">Insights, recommendations and trends are rendered for the role that asked, as structured visualisation, contextual drilldown, ad-hoc analysis and API-driven access.</desc><g class="gnd"><path d="M110 650H1266"/><path d="M190 700H1186"/><path d="M330 650l-46 50M620 650l-30 50M900 650l30 50M1150 650l46 50"/></g><path class="spine" d="M404 420H972"/><path class="flow" pathLength="100" d="M404 420H972"/><text class="cap" x="74" y="80">WHAT ARRIVES</text><text class="cap" x="544" y="80">RENDERED FOR THE ROLE</text><text class="cap" x="972" y="80">HOW IT IS USED</text><path class="wire" d="M404 344.0C474.0 344.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 420.0C474.0 420.0 474.0 420.0 544 420 M404 496.0C474.0 496.0 474.0 420.0 544 420"/><path class="wire" d="M972 306.0C902.0 306.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 382.0C902.0 382.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 458.0C902.0 458.0 902.0 420.0 832 420 M972 534.0C902.0 534.0 902.0 420.0 832 420"/><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="315.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="344.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="352.0">Insights</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="391.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="420.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="428.0">Recommendations</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="74" y="467.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="496.0" r="5"/><text x="124" y="504.0">Trends</text></g><g class="core"><rect x="544" y="316" width="288" height="176" rx="16"/><path d="M544 358h288"/><circle class="hair" cx="586" cy="337" r="5"/><circle class="hair" cx="602" cy="337" r="5"/><g class="bar"><rect x="588" y="424" width="26" height="46" rx="5"/><rect x="624" y="404" width="26" height="66" rx="5"/><rect x="660" y="440" width="26" height="30" rx="5"/></g><path class="trend" d="M706 452l24-30 22 16 26-46"/><text class="fn" x="688" y="554">ROLE-CENTRIC RENDER</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="277.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="306.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="314.0">Structured visuals</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="353.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="382.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="390.0">Contextual drilldown</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="429.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="458.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="466.0">Ad-hoc analysis</text></g><g class="chip"><rect x="972" y="505.0" width="330" height="58" rx="12"/><circle cx="998" cy="534.0" r="5"/><text x="1022" y="542.0">API access</text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(400,118)"><rect width="345" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd ok" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Rendering <tspan class="v">Persona-first</tspan></text></g><g class="spill" transform="translate(940,600)"><rect width="274" height="46" rx="23"/><circle class="pd" cx="26" cy="23" r="6"/><text x="46" y="30">Access <tspan class="v">App or API</tspan></text></g></svg></div><div class="t"><span>04 / 04 &middot; Experience Layer</span><h3>Role-centric application workflow</h3><p>Where users engage, interact and are driven by generative AI based rendering of structured, ad-hoc analysis using computer and natural language processing for their roles.</p><p class="jd">One of the distinguishing features of the ITHENA platform is the persona or role-centricity. Driven by a combination of human and artificial intelligence, we provide analytical outcomes to the relevant persona, and not just the art-of-the-possible scenarios! Our applications bring the best user experience for THAT role, driven by actionable workflows and machine-learned intelligence.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="ph-sec ph-explore sec" id="explore"><div class="frame"><div class="shead center rv"><p class="kicker center">Explore</p><h2>See how our solutions utilize the value of our platform</h2><p class="lede">Three routes in: the industries we have already delivered in, the solutions grouped by the job they do, and the services that put them into production. Pick the one closest to your question.</p></div><div class="explore stg"><div class="ecol rv"><h3>Case Studies</h3><p>Understand use cases of our platform by industries.</p><div class="elist"><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/case-studies/">Technology <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/case-studies/">Industry / Vertical <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/case-studies/">Solutions <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/case-studies/">Use Case <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="ecol rv"><h3>Solutions</h3><p>Our solutions deployed across use cases by function.</p><div class="elist"><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/digital-shopfloor/">Digital Shopfloor <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/manufacturing-excellence/">Manufacturing Excellence <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/smart-service/">Smart Service <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/ai-mro/">AI MRO <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/panel-ops/">Panel Ops <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/the-agentic-oem/">The Agentic OEM <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="ecol rv"><h3>Services</h3><p>How we integrate the value of our platform to accelerate delivery.</p><div class="elist"><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/industrial-iot/">Industrial IoT <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/big-data-analytics/">Big Data &amp; Analytics <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/ai-ml-data-science/">AI/ML | Data Science <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/ai-strategy/">AI Strategy <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a href="https://dev-website.ithena.app/customer-experience/">Customer Experience <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="ph-sec ph-cta sec cta" id="start"><video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="https://dev-website.ithena.app/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ith-home-control-room-poster.jpg"><source src="https://dev-website.ithena.app/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ith-home-control-room.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="frame"><p class="kicker center">Get started</p><h2>Build your smart connected enterprise.</h2><p class="lede">See the platform running against your data. Role-specific outcomes in weeks, not quarters.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#start" data-schedule-demo>Schedule a demo <svg class="i"><use href="#p-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="btn btn-glass" href="#layers">Review the layers</a></div></div></section></div><div class="schedule-popup-overlay" id="schedulePopup" data-schedule-popup hidden><div class="schedule-popup" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="schedulePopupTitle" tabindex="-1"><button type="button" class="schedule-popup-close" data-schedule-popup-close aria-label="Close dialog"><svg class="i"><use href="#p-x"/></svg></button><div class="schedule-popup-head"><p class="kicker">Get started</p><h3 id="schedulePopupTitle">Schedule a demo</h3><p>Tell us what you run and which outcomes matter. We will follow up to find a time that works.</p></div><div class="schedule-popup-form" id="schedulePopupFormSlot"><p class="schedule-popup-empty">The form did not load. Email <a href="mailto:sales@ithena.ai">sales@ithena.ai</a> and we will set the session up for you.</p></div></div></div></section>
<script>(function(){
"use strict";
var root=document.querySelector("section#main-section.platform");
if(!root) return;
var reduced=window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;
var $=function(s,c){return (c||root).querySelector(s);};
var $$=function(s,c){return Array.prototype.slice.call((c||root).querySelectorAll(s));};
var themeToggle=document.getElementById("themeToggle");
function setTheme(mode){
root.setAttribute("data-theme",mode);
if(themeToggle) themeToggle.setAttribute("aria-pressed",mode==="dark"?"true":"false");
try{localStorage.setItem("fbb-theme",mode);}catch(e){}
}
var stored=null;
try{stored=localStorage.getItem("fbb-theme");}catch(e){}
setTheme(stored==="light"||stored==="dark"?stored:"dark");
function bindToggle(el){
if(!el||el.dataset.phBound) return;
el.dataset.phBound="1"; themeToggle=el; setTheme(root.getAttribute("data-theme"));
el.addEventListener("click",function(){
setTheme(root.getAttribute("data-theme")==="dark"?"light":"dark");
});
}
bindToggle(themeToggle);
if(!themeToggle){
var seek=new MutationObserver(function(){
var el=document.getElementById("themeToggle");
if(el){bindToggle(el);seek.disconnect();}
});
seek.observe(document.documentElement,{childList:true,subtree:true});
setTimeout(function(){seek.disconnect();},10000);
}
var jwrap=$(".jwrap"),jpin=$(".jpin"),jprog=$(".jprog"),
jplates=$$(".jplate .lfig"),jcopies=$$(".jcopy > div"),jrail=$$(".jrail li");
var jN=jcopies.length,jbeat=-1,jlock=false,jty=null;
function setBeat(i){
if(i===jbeat) return;
jbeat=i;
if(jpin) jpin.dataset.beat=String(i);
jplates.forEach(function(el,k){el.classList.toggle("on",k===i);});
jcopies.forEach(function(el,k){el.classList.toggle("on",k===i);});
jrail.forEach(function(el,k){el.classList.toggle("on",k===i);});
if(jprog) jprog.style.setProperty("width",(((i+1)/jN)*100).toFixed(2)+"%","important");
}
function jStuck(){
if(!jpin||getComputedStyle(jpin).display==="none") return false;
var r=jpin.getBoundingClientRect(),tol=Math.max(48,window.innerHeight*0.08);
return r.top<=tol&&r.bottom>=window.innerHeight-tol;
}
function jCanStep(dir){return dir>0?jbeat<jN-1:jbeat>0;}
function jStep(dir){
if(jlock) return;
jlock=true;
setBeat(jbeat+dir);
setTimeout(function(){jlock=false;},700);
}
function jTyping(){
var a=document.activeElement;
return !!a&&/^(INPUT|TEXTAREA|SELECT)$/.test(a.tagName);
}
if(jwrap&&jpin){
setBeat(0);
window.addEventListener("wheel",function(e){
if(!jStuck()||Math.abs(e.deltaY)<2) return;
var dir=e.deltaY>0?1:-1;
if(!jCanStep(dir)) return;
e.preventDefault();
jStep(dir);
},{passive:false});
window.addEventListener("touchstart",function(e){jty=e.touches[0].clientY;},{passive:true});
window.addEventListener("touchmove",function(e){
if(jty===null||!jStuck()) return;
var dy=jty-e.touches[0].clientY;
if(Math.abs(dy)<40) return;
var dir=dy>0?1:-1;
if(!jCanStep(dir)) return;
e.preventDefault();
jty=e.touches[0].clientY;
jStep(dir);
},{passive:false});
window.addEventListener("touchend",function(){jty=null;},{passive:true});
window.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){
if(!jStuck()||jTyping()) return;
var dir=(e.key==="ArrowDown"||e.key==="PageDown")?1:(e.key==="ArrowUp"||e.key==="PageUp")?-1:0;
if(!dir||!jCanStep(dir)) return;
e.preventDefault();
jStep(dir);
});
jrail.forEach(function(el,k){
var jump=function(){
if(getComputedStyle(jpin).display==="none") return;
var fix=function(){if(jStuck()) return;var d=jpin.getBoundingClientRect().top;if(d>1) window.scrollBy(0,d);};
fix();requestAnimationFrame(function(){fix();requestAnimationFrame(fix);});
jlock=false;setBeat(k);
};
el.addEventListener("click",jump);
el.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){if(e.key==="Enter"||e.key===" "){e.preventDefault();jump();}});
});
}
var schedulePopup=document.getElementById("schedulePopup");
if(schedulePopup){
var schedulePanel=schedulePopup.querySelector(".schedule-popup");
var scheduleFormSlot=document.getElementById("schedulePopupFormSlot");
var scheduleFormMoved=false,lastFocused=null;
function adoptScheduleForm(){
if(scheduleFormMoved||!scheduleFormSlot) return;
var src=document.querySelector("#schedule-demo-form, .schedule-demo-form");
if(!src){
var widgets=document.querySelectorAll(".elementor-widget-shortcode");
for(var i=0;i<widgets.length;i++){if(widgets[i].querySelector(".frm_forms, form")){src=widgets[i];break;}}
}
if(!src) src=document.querySelector(".frm_forms");
if(!src||schedulePopup.contains(src)) return;
scheduleFormSlot.innerHTML="";
scheduleFormSlot.appendChild(src);
src.style.display="block";
scheduleFormMoved=true;
}
if(document.readyState==="loading"){document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded",adoptScheduleForm);}else{adoptScheduleForm();}
window.addEventListener("load",adoptScheduleForm);
function onScheduleKeydown(e){if(e.key==="Escape") closeSchedulePopup();}
function openSchedulePopup(e){
if(e) e.preventDefault();
adoptScheduleForm();
lastFocused=document.activeElement;
schedulePopup.hidden=false;
document.body.style.overflow="hidden";
document.addEventListener("keydown",onScheduleKeydown);
requestAnimationFrame(function(){
schedulePopup.classList.add("is-open");
requestAnimationFrame(function(){
var f=schedulePopup.querySelector(".schedule-popup-form input:not([type=hidden]):not([type=submit]):not([type=button]):not([disabled]), .schedule-popup-form textarea:not([disabled]), .schedule-popup-form select:not([disabled])")||schedulePopup.querySelector("[data-schedule-popup-close]");
if(f) f.focus();
});
});
}
function closeSchedulePopup(){
schedulePopup.classList.remove("is-open");
document.body.style.overflow="";
document.removeEventListener("keydown",onScheduleKeydown);
setTimeout(function(){schedulePopup.hidden=true;},250);
if(lastFocused&&typeof lastFocused.focus==="function") lastFocused.focus();
}
Array.prototype.forEach.call(document.querySelectorAll("[data-schedule-demo]"),function(b){b.addEventListener("click",openSchedulePopup);});
Array.prototype.forEach.call(schedulePopup.querySelectorAll("[data-schedule-popup-close]"),function(el){el.addEventListener("click",closeSchedulePopup);});
schedulePopup.addEventListener("click",function(e){if(e.target===schedulePopup) closeSchedulePopup();});
if(schedulePanel) schedulePanel.addEventListener("click",function(e){e.stopPropagation();});
}
if("IntersectionObserver" in window && !reduced){
var io=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){
es.forEach(function(en){
if(!en.isIntersecting) return;
en.target.classList.add("on");
$$("[data-count]",en.target).forEach(function(el){var to=parseFloat(el.dataset.count),sfx=el.dataset.suffix||"",dec=(el.dataset.count.split(".")[1]||"").length,t0=0;var step=function(ts){if(!t0)t0=ts;var k=Math.min((ts-t0)/1100,1),e=1-Math.pow(1-k,3);el.textContent=(to*e).toFixed(dec)+sfx;if(k<1)requestAnimationFrame(step);};requestAnimationFrame(step);});
io.unobserve(en.target);
});
},{threshold:.16,rootMargin:"0px 0px -40px 0px"});
$$(".rv").forEach(function(el){io.observe(el);});
}else{
$$(".rv").forEach(function(el){el.classList.add("on");});
}
})();</script>
